{
  "title": "Quietly Baked Norwegian Fennel Bake",
  "description": "A traditional Norwegian dish featuring fennel bulb, this bake is perfect for a midnight craving, with its funky and velvety texture, and is satvik-friendly. It is wood-fired-baked to perfection.",
  "cuisine": "Norwegian",
